                    {
                        "sense_id": "c785c7d3-6e18-3b3b-9155-4063962147f4",
                        "entry_id": "6face343-ea2b-3e5b-8ff1-25f3bff5b249",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Death, the Grim Reaper"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "colloquial"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "beedc830-9c58-44bb-a8a3-62625ffa48ae",
                                "sense_id": "c785c7d3-6e18-3b3b-9155-4063962147f4",
                                "text": "Бу́дете вот сиде́ть на своём чемода́не, а в оди́н пого́жий денёк я́вится к вам костля́вая ― и косо́й по ше́е.",
                                "translation": "So you'll be sitting on your suitcase, and then one fine day the Grim Reaper will come to you and slice your neck with his scythe.",
                                "english": "So you'll be sitting on your suitcase, and then one fine day the Grim Reaper will come to you and slice your neck with his scythe."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
